Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,What if Tanjiro could hear
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.02,0:00:02.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,demons' thoughts?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.18,0:00:03.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,The universe added notifications\Nwith
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.68,0:00:05.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,no mute button available.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.10,0:00:06.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,This is an invented ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.68,0:00:08.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,Understanding suffering might\Nhelp him
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.08,0:00:09.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,protect people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.06,0:00:10.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Instead, fear and memories\Narrive
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:10.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.90,0:00:11.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,Welcome to a cursed open
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.82,0:00:12.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,-plan office.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.84,0:00:13.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,Terrible acoustics.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.86,0:00:14.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,Zenitsu asks if it helps,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.94,0:00:15.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,screams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.60,0:00:16.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,Outstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.44,0:00:18.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,His own emergency broadcast\Nsystem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.24,0:00:18.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,A demon thinks it means
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.94,0:00:20.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,no harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.06,0:00:21.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,Reassuring, except hearing a\Nthought
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.56,0:00:22.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,doesn't make it reliable.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.70,0:00:24.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,Frightened people can hurt\Nothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.34,0:00:26.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,Confident memories can mislead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.16,0:00:27.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,Empathy still needs evidence and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.48,0:00:28.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,practical boundaries.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.62,0:00:29.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,Nezuko reminds him why he
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.84,0:00:30.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,cares.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.64,0:00:32.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,Someone can deserve compassion\Nwithout
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.10,0:00:34.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,everybody else surrendering\Ntheir safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.04,0:00:35.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,He protects bystanders first,\Nthen
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.54,0:00:36.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,listens.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.70,0:00:37.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,He installed a firewall on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.42,0:00:38.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,that enormous heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.38,0:00:39.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,A hidden memory suggests a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.50,0:00:41.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,missing person's location.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.00,0:00:42.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,He checks instead of trusting
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.00,0:00:42.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,blindly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.90,0:00:43.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,The ability helps.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.75,0:00:45.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,Zenitsu asks if Tanjiro can
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.25,0:00:46.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,mute him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.19,0:00:47.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,Different species, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.33,0:00:48.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,Your volume is a local
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.17,0:00:49.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,government issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.41,0:00:50.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,Understanding doesn't promise\Nagreement or
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.81,0:00:52.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,painless solutions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.25,0:00:53.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,The new ability changes his
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.27,0:00:55.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,choices, not every consequence\Noutside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.51,0:00:56.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,Tanjiro keeps his kindness and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.95,0:00:58.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,learns restraint.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.21,0:00:59.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,The upgrade wasn't hearing\Neverything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.87,0:01:00.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,It was knowing when to listen.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.96,Heading,,0,0,0,,THE WORST GROUP CHAT
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.96,0:00:08.86,Heading,,0,0,0,,A FAN MADE EXTRA ABILITY
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.86,0:00:13.75,Heading,,0,0,0,,TOO MUCH INFORMATION
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.75,0:00:18.15,Heading,,0,0,0,,ZENITSU WOULD LIKE TO DECLINE
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.15,0:00:22.70,Heading,,0,0,0,,A DANGEROUS ASSUMPTION
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.70,0:00:28.57,Heading,,0,0,0,,EMPATHY NEEDS EVIDENCE
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.57,0:00:34.00,Heading,,0,0,0,,REMEMBER THE PERSON
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.00,0:00:38.28,Heading,,0,0,0,,PROTECT FIRST LISTEN TOO
Dialogue: 1,0:00:38.28,0:00:43.75,Heading,,0,0,0,,USE THE DETAIL
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.75,0:00:49.10,Heading,,0,0,0,,THE COMPLAINT DEPARTMENT
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.10,0:00:55.49,Heading,,0,0,0,,NO PERFECT EASY ENDING
Dialogue: 1,0:00:55.49,0:01:01.00,Heading,,0,0,0,,KEEP THE HEART ADD SETTINGS
